# Fireshrieker {3}, Equip {2}: "Equipped creature has double strike." Only the Mountain is untapped after casting it, one mana
# short of the equip cost (refused); two Moxen pay it. The equipped Memnite (1/1) hits Bot2 for 1 in each damage step, 2 in
# all; the unequipped Ornithopter has no keyword but flying. Moving Fireshrieker to the Ornithopter takes the double strike off the Memnite.

